{"3015600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fading Faith", "steam_appid": 3015600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BENEATH JERUSALEM</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-Person Dungeon Crawling:</strong> Explore a claustrophobic, atmospheric world based on the real-world ruins and secret passages hidden beneath the Holy City.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/94c7a1d1863194637de391091b6d6af3.poster.avif?t=1776688327\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/94c7a1d1863194637de391091b6d6af3.webm?t=1776688327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/94c7a1d1863194637de391091b6d6af3.mp4?t=1776688327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DANGEROUS DUNGEONS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Auri Mortui:</strong> Face the &quot;Gilded Dead&quot;, previous scavengers who were consumed by their obsession. They entered these tunnels for gold and never left; now, they wander the dark as hollow husks, protecting their hoard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/f013b2f828849126d8ced26cc7eb1711.poster.avif?t=1776688327\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/f013b2f828849126d8ced26cc7eb1711.webm?t=1776688327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/f013b2f828849126d8ced26cc7eb1711.mp4?t=1776688327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LOOT AND SURVIVE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gold is your only leverage. Every coin you find must be brought back to the surface to pay your way. <strong>Manage your resources wisely</strong> to buy the gear and supplies needed for your next descent into the deep.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/c84ee2af42d98569e2d3b313a80330b2.poster.avif?t=1776688327\" width=800 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/c84ee2af42d98569e2d3b313a80330b2.webm?t=1776688327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/c84ee2af42d98569e2d3b313a80330b2.mp4?t=1776688327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Authentic History: THE DUNGEONPEDIA</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax and explore the DungeonPedia, a comprehensive encyclopedia featuring history professor Peter. Unlock custom videos for every achievement you earn to learn the true stories behind the ruins and artifacts you discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/1aab440a66ffc7b512ed53478d612089.poster.avif?t=1776688327\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/1aab440a66ffc7b512ed53478d612089.webm?t=1776688327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/1aab440a66ffc7b512ed53478d612089.mp4?t=1776688327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BENEATH JERUSALEM</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-Person Dungeon Crawling:</strong> Explore a claustrophobic, atmospheric world based on the real-world ruins and secret passages hidden beneath the Holy City.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/94c7a1d1863194637de391091b6d6af3.poster.avif?t=1776688327\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/94c7a1d1863194637de391091b6d6af3.webm?t=1776688327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/94c7a1d1863194637de391091b6d6af3.mp4?t=1776688327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DANGEROUS DUNGEONS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Auri Mortui:</strong> Face the &quot;Gilded Dead&quot;, previous scavengers who were consumed by their obsession. They entered these tunnels for gold and never left; now, they wander the dark as hollow husks, protecting their hoard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/f013b2f828849126d8ced26cc7eb1711.poster.avif?t=1776688327\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/f013b2f828849126d8ced26cc7eb1711.webm?t=1776688327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/f013b2f828849126d8ced26cc7eb1711.mp4?t=1776688327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LOOT AND SURVIVE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gold is your only leverage. Every coin you find must be brought back to the surface to pay your way. <strong>Manage your resources wisely</strong> to buy the gear and supplies needed for your next descent into the deep.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/c84ee2af42d98569e2d3b313a80330b2.poster.avif?t=1776688327\" width=800 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/c84ee2af42d98569e2d3b313a80330b2.webm?t=1776688327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/c84ee2af42d98569e2d3b313a80330b2.mp4?t=1776688327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Authentic History: THE DUNGEONPEDIA</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax and explore the DungeonPedia, a comprehensive encyclopedia featuring history professor Peter. Unlock custom videos for every achievement you earn to learn the true stories behind the ruins and artifacts you discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/1aab440a66ffc7b512ed53478d612089.poster.avif?t=1776688327\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/1aab440a66ffc7b512ed53478d612089.webm?t=1776688327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/extras/1aab440a66ffc7b512ed53478d612089.mp4?t=1776688327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Survive the deadly ruins of Ancient Jerusalem in this first-person dungeon crawler. Armed only with a torch, face a high risk, high reward dilemma: push deeper for gold or escape before your light fades. Scavenge to survive the city above or become another hollow guardian of the deep.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Arabic<strong>*</strong>, Greek<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Polish<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Turkish<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Portugal<strong>*</strong>, Indonesian<strong>*</strong>, Hebrew, Korean<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/6131776c957b561a8550b77d5336aa83140e608e/header.jpg?t=1776688327", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/5a1251ea276fc400b4ee6ed61b7850f6d5da3a3a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776688327", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015600/5a1251ea276fc400b4ee6ed61b7850f6d5da3a3a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776688327", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 4Gb Ram<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Direct X Compatible</li></ul>", "recom